Onboarding illustrations
------------------------
setup-link.svg, about-you.svg, course-units.svg, target-cgpa.svg, results.svg,
and finish.svg are original CGP illustrations created for this project. They
use the existing CGP Tailwind palette and contain no third-party assets.

Magic UI effects
----------------
The NumberTicker, AnimatedCircularProgressBar, AnimatedList, BlurFade, and
Confetti components are adapted from Magic UI (https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui),
licensed under the MIT License.

